msgctxt "80"
msgid "I better go check in with Shiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone about this... but do you think you can\r\n"
"find out who's been bullying Shiro for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I already know. That's what I was trying to tell you before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Who is it?"
msgstr "Chi è?"

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Some kid named Yoshinori, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "Ma cosa?"

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"...It's kinda complicated. Yoshinori's the son of Shiro's\r\n"
"teacher, Hashimoto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Ne sei sicuro?"

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Hashimoto would be in big trouble if he admitted his own son\r\n"
"was a bully... so I dunno if he'll ever fess up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Well now I really need to get involved. I'd better check\r\n"
"with Shiro again to make sure."
msgstr ""

